 "_methodology": "MONOTONIC FUNNEL (rank roll-up). Stage ranks: Initial Interview=1, Client Endorsement=2, Client Interview=3, Job Offer=4, Offer Accepted/Ongoing Contract=5, Started=6, Failed=0. A match at rank K emits one dated event for every rank R<=K (it must have passed through them), dated by: rank1 interview_at, rank2 submitted_at, rank3 interview_at, rank4 offer_at, rank5 hired_at, rank6 updated_at - each falling back to updated_at when null. Events are pooled per CANDIDATE. For month M and rank R, a candidate is counted if they have any event in M at rank >= R, which makes Interviews>=Endorsed>=ClientPass>=Offers>=Hires>=Starts true by construction. YTD totals are unique candidates by max rank reached, so YTD is NOT the sum of the months (a candidate active in three months counts once in YTD but in all three monthly columns).",
